        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Senakelibu ŵaputile ngondo ni ŵandu ŵa cilambo ca Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panyuma pakwe pigamasile masengo gakwatumicila AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " mwakulupicika, Senakelibu mwenye jwa ku Asiliya ŵayice kuputa ngondo ni ŵandu ŵa ku cilambo ca Yuda, nipo ŵajisyungulile misinda jijaliji mkati mwa mapupajo aciganisyaga kuti tiŵakamulememo ŵandu wosope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekiya piŵaweni kuti Senakelibu ayice kusumula msinda wa Yelusalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jwalakwe pamo ni nduna syakwe ŵaganisisye yakuti akawugale nduluko sya mesi sisyaliji kusa kwa msindawo ni cakulinga cakuti Asiliya akagasimana mesi pitaciyika ciŵandika ni ku Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndunasyo syalongolele ŵandu ŵajinji nipo ŵajile kukuwugala nduluko sya mesisyo, mwakuti pangali soni mesi gagakopwece mwelemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Mwenye Hesekiya ŵalimbisye citetelo ca msindawo pakulinganya soni lipupa, ni sanja penani pa lipupalyo, ŵataŵile soni lipupa lya kusa. Kupwatika soni pelepo, ŵalinganyisye soni lipupa lya citetelo pa malo ga mbali ja kungopoko lyuŵa kwa Yelusalemu. Ŵapanganyisye soni mipamba ni yakucijila yejinji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵasagwile soni acimlongola ŵa ngondo kuti ŵalamulileje ŵandu, ni kwasonganya jemanjajo pa luŵala lwa cipata cakwinjilila mu msindamo, nipo ŵasalile kuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mŵe ŵamacili ni ŵakulimba mtima, mkasimwajogopa mwenye ŵa ku Asiliya ni likuga lyawo lya asilikali ŵali nawoŵa, pakuti uwe tuli ŵamacili kwapunda jemanjajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵelewo akwete likuga lya ngondo lya ŵandu, nambo uwe tuli ni AMBUJE, Mlungu jwetu jwakutukamusya, soni ni jwakutuputila ngondo syetu.” Ŵandu ŵakulupilile maloŵe ga Hesekiya mwenye jwa ku Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piyamasile yeleyi, pa ndaŵi jele Mwenye Senakelibu jwa ku Asiliya pamo ni asilikali ŵakwe ŵaŵasyungulile msinda wa Lakishi, ŵatumisye utenga wakuyicisyawu kwa Hesekiya ni kwa ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda ni ŵaŵaliji nawo ku Yelusalemu wakwasalila kuti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Une, Senakelibu, mwenye jwa ku Asiliya, ngumwusya kuti, ana cimkulimbisya mtima jemanja ni cici kuti mkanilileje kutama ku Yelusalemu kuno ni kusyungulilidwa ni asilikali? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekiya akumsalila jemanja kuti AMBUJE, Mlungu jwenu tacimkulupusya kutyocela myala mwa mwenye jwa ku Asiliya, nambotu Hesekiya akumlambusya jemanja nipo tacimleka jemanja kuti m'we ni sala ni njota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakweju ni juŵatyosisye malo gakulambila ni malo gakupelecela mbopesi, nipo kaneko ŵasalile ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda ni ku Yelusalemu kuti alambileje ni kutinisya ubani",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " pa malo gampepe basi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana jemanja ngamkumanyilila yele une ni acinangolo ŵangu yitwatesile kwa ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Ana milungu ja ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine jakulupwisye ŵandu ŵawo kutyocela myala mwa mwenye jwa ku Asiliya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana sikati ja milungu jesope ja mitundu jine ja ŵanduwo jele baba ŵangu jiŵajijonasile, ana nduni juŵapakombwele kwakulupusya ŵandu ŵakwe m'magasa mwangu? Ana cikumtendesya ni cici kuti mganisyeje kuti mlungu jwenu akomboleka kumkulupusya jemanja? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano mkasimumkunda Hesekiya kuti amlambusye jemanja kapena kumsokonesya mwamti myoyo. Mkasimwakulupilila ŵelewo! Pangali mlungu jwa mtundu uliwose wa ŵandu juŵapakombwele kwakulupusya ŵandu ŵakwe kutyocela myala mwa mwenye jwa ku Asiliya. Myoyo jwele mlungu jwenujo ngakomboleka kumkulupusya jemanja!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nduna sya mwenye jwa ku Asiliya syaŵecete yejinji yakusakala yakwamba AMBUJE, Mlungu pamo ni Hesekiya, jwakutumicila jwawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Mwenye Senakelibu ŵalembile yikalata yakwanyosya AMBUJE, Mlungu jwa ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli, nipo ŵatite kuti, “Milungu ja ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine ŵa mu yilambo yine nganijipakombola kwakulupusya ŵandu kutyocela myala mwa asilikali ŵa ku Asiliya, myoyo mlungu jwa Hesekiya ngasapakombola kwakulupusya ŵandu ŵawo m'magasa mwangu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndunasyo syaŵecete yosope yeneyi mu ciŵeceto ca Cihebeli kwa ŵandu ŵa mu msinda wa Yelusalemu kuti jwalijose juŵapikanilaga kutyocela pepupa lya msindawo apikanicisye cenene ni kuti atende woga kuti jemanjajo asumule msindawo mwangasawusya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵaŵecetaga ya Mlungu jwa ku Yelusalemu mpela muŵaŵecetelaga ya milungu ja ŵandu ŵane pa cilambo capasi pano, jele jajili jakupanganyikwa ni magasa ga mundu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Hesekiya pamo ni jwakulocesya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Yesaya mwanace jwa Amosi, ŵapopesile kwa Mlungu kuŵenda cikamucisyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo AMBUJE ŵalitumile lilayika, ni lyawuleje asilikali wosope ni nduna sya ku Asiliya. Senakelibu jwawujile kumangwakwe juli jwa soni. Lyuŵa line piŵaliji m'nyumba ja mlungu jwawo, ŵanace ŵakwe ŵacalume ŵamwuleje jwalakwejo ni mapanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵamkulupwisye Hesekiya mwalitala lyeleli pamo ni ŵandu wosope ŵaŵatamaga ku Yelusalemu kutyocela myala mwa Senakelibu, mwenye jwa ku Asiliya, ni kwa amagongo ŵawo wosope, nipo ŵacinjilicisye jemanjajo myala mwa amagongo ŵawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵajinji ŵayice ku Yelusalemu ali ajigele yakupeleka kwa AMBUJE, ni mituka jine ja Hesekiya mwenye jwa ku Yuda. Kutyocela ndaŵi jelejo Hesekiya ŵapocelaga ucimbicimbi kutyocela kwa ŵandu wosope.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kulwala kwa Hesekiya ni masengo gakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
