          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pandaŵi jelejo Hesekiya ŵalwasile, nipo ŵasigele panandi kuwa, myoyo ŵapopesile kwa AMBUJE, nipo AMBUJE ŵamjanjile jwalakwejo nipo ŵampele cimanyisyo cakuti talame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekiya ŵatandite kulinonyela pa yele Mlungu yiŵamtendele jwalakwejo, nipo AMBUJE ŵatumbilile ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda ni ku Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pambesi pakwe, Hesekiya pamo ni ŵandu ŵaŵatamaga ku Yelusalemu ŵalinondiye acimsyene, nipo AMBUJE nganiŵapa jemanjajo cilango mpaka pa ndaŵi jiŵawile Hesekiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yipanje ya Hesekiya ni lumbili lwawo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Hesekiya ŵasicile mnope nipo jwalijose ŵamcimbicisyaga jwalakwejo. Ŵataŵile yipinda yakusunjilamo golidi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " silifa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " magaganga ga mtengo wapenani, yakununjilisya mboga, yakucijila ni yindu yine ya mtengo wapenani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵalinganyisye soni ngokwe syakusunjila tiligu, finyo, ni mawuta ga olifi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵapanganyisye soni macinga ga ng'ombe ni ga ngondolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakuti AMBUJE ŵamsicilisye mnope jwalakwejo nipo ŵakwete ng'ombe, ngondolo ni mbusi syejinji, mwakuti jwalakwe ŵataŵile soni misinda jawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekiya ni ŵaŵawugele ngalande ja mesi jakutyocela ku Lusulo lwa Gihoni nipo ŵajisepwisye ngalandejo kuti jijawule mkati mwa msinda wa Yelusalemu. Yindu yosope yamjendelaga cenene Hesekiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nipo atamose piŵayice ŵa mitenga ŵakutyocela ku Babiloniya kuwusya ya yindu yiyatendekwe mcilambomo, Mlungu ŵamlesile Hesekiya jika kuti amlinje ni kumanyilila yosope ya mu mtima mwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kumala kwa ucimwene wa Hesekiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masengo gosope giŵatesile Hesekiya piŵaliji mwenye, pamo ni yambone yiŵatendaga, yilembedwe mu ngani syakwamba yiŵayiweni m'mesomkulola jwakulocesya Yesaya, mwanace jwa Amosi ni mu Mbili ja Ayimwene ŵa ku Yuda ni ku Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekiya ŵawile nipo ŵamsicile mbali ja kumkuli m'malembe ga ŵanace ŵa Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Ŵandu wosope ŵa ku Yuda ni ku Yelusalemu ŵamcimbicisye mnope jwalakwejo. Manase ni juŵajinjile ucimwene m'malo mwa babagwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
